meta {
  name: Enable 2FA
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/v1/auth/2fa/enable
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Starts enrolment. Returns `secret`, `backup_codes` and `provisioning_uri` — paste the
  provisioning URI into any TOTP app, or into a QR-code generator to scan it.

  **The factor is not active yet.** Confirm it with a code from the app via `Confirm 2FA`.
  Only the hashes of the recovery codes are stored, so this response is the one and only
  time you can read them.
}
